OL,3,GNEWSASquash player, 80, wins record
OL,4,Aseventh title
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old woman has beaten the
OL,7,Fwomen's world record for squash masters
OL,8,Ftitles after winning a tournament in
OL,9,FAustralia.
OL,11,FAnn Manley, from Stoke Bishop, Bristol,
OL,12,Fhas loved the sport ever since she was
OL,13,Fa teenager and this month won the over
OL,14,F80s category at the World Squash
OL,15,FMasters Championships in Perth.
OL,17,FManley now has seven titles in
OL,18,Fdifferent age groups, tying her for the
OL,19,Fcrown of most titles won by a player
OL,20,Fwith Australia's Geoff Davenport.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
