OL,3,GNEWSASquash player, 80, wins record
OL,4,Aseventh title
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe had thought of making this her last
OL,7,Ftournament, but now may continue. "Its
OL,8,Flovely having the age events so you can
OL,9,Fkeep playing at your own standard,"
OL,10,FManley said.
